This artifact vendors the "brainstorming" skill from obra/superpowers.

Vendored files (upstream paths):
  - skills/brainstorming/SKILL.md
  - skills/brainstorming/spec-document-reviewer-prompt.md

SKILL.md is ADAPTED, not verbatim. Patronus re-coupled it into its own lifecycle
(see .github/decisions/0001-profiles-recouple-plugins-stay-as-is.md) with three additions:
an explicit ASCII-diagram step at design-presentation points, a `grilling` hand-off
offered after design approval (before the spec is written), and a `research-team`
hand-off at the scope-assessment step for genuinely unknown domains. The body
otherwise follows upstream.

spec-document-reviewer-prompt.md is copied verbatim.

